name: sim.computeMassAndInertia
description: Computes and applies the mass and inertia matrix for a shape, based on its convex representation. When calling this function while the simulation is running, one should then call sim.resetDynamicObject, for the changes to take effect
luaSynopsis: int result = sim.computeMassAndInertia(int shapeHandle, float density)
pythonSynopsis: int result = sim.computeMassAndInertia(int shapeHandle, float density)
inputs:
1. shapeHandle: handle of shape
2. density: density expressed in kg/m^3
outputs:
1. result: 0 if the shape is not convex, otherwise 1
replacedBy:
- name: computeInertia, class: shape, file: shape_computeInertia.method
